+ # Feasibility runs the full costmap footprint check (radius 0.14 against
+ # inflation cost, not the 0.05 soft margin below).  With dt_ref 0.45 s and
+ # max_vel_x 0.18, five poses reach ~0.4 m ahead, deep inside the 0.29--0.32 m
+ # doorways where inflated cost is unavoidable -- the 8/27 "valid control
